  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Pre-positioning and Distribution of NFI and Winterization Relief Items in NWS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to replenish the Shelter and Non-Food Items (S-NFI) Cluster emergency pipeline stock for Northwest Syria (NWS) through the procurement, quality control, transshipment, as well as potential distribution, based on sudden shocks and winterization needs, of 4,152 winterization kits, 1,935 NFI kits and 1,350 tents. Shelter repair kits were removed from the proposed project following feedback from the S-NFI Cluster on the 2022 First Reserve Allocation Strategy. The thermal blanket specifications (IOM will procure blankets that fit two individuals each), as well as the kitchen sets, match the guidelines set by the S-NFI Cluster.</narrative>
  </description>
